    "identifier": "1-strike-slash",
    "description": "<p>You perform a wide arcing slash with your weapon, slicing into them with little wasted movement.</p>\n<p>Make a melee taijutsu attack using your weapon, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 3d6. On a hit, the target must also make a Constitution saving throw gaining 1 rank of Bleeding on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If your attack misses, you can attempt to remake the attack, but against a different creature in range.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
